{
  "n": 16,
  "title": "Wishes and advice",
  "sub": "quiero que vengas, espero que, ojalá",
  "can": "Give advice and say what you hope for with the subjuntivo: quiero que vengas.",
  "mins": 15,
  "doneText": "You can now give advice, say what you want others to do, and wish people well the Spanish way.",
  "skills": {
    "subj-form": "Swapped endings: hable, coma",
    "subj-yo": "From the yo form: tenga, haga, venga",
    "subj-wish": "Wishes: espero que, ojalá, que lo pases bien",
    "subj-advice": "Advice: te recomiendo que, es mejor que",
    "subj-or-inf": "Quiero ir or quiero que vayas"
  },
  "discover": {
    "intro": "Both colours want something. Look at who will do it, and at the verb after it.",
    "groups": [
      {
