            "Quiero que vengas.",
            "I want you to come."
          ],
          [
            "Espero que comas bien.",
            "I hope you eat well."
          ],
          [
            "Prefiero que hables tú.",
            "I'd rather you spoke."
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "For yourself",
        "tone": "orange",
        "lines": [
