            "I'd rather speak myself."
          ]
        ]
      }
    ],
    "question": "When does the verb change to vengas, comas, hables?",
    "options": [
      "When you want, hope or prefer something for someone else, after que.",
      "When the sentence is a question.",
      "When it happened in the past."
    ],
    "answer": 0,
    "nudge": "Not quite. Look for que in the blue sentences, and who does the second verb.",
