      {
        "type": "note",
        "kind": "tip",
        "text": "Start from the yo form now, drop the -o and swap the vowel: hablo becomes hable, como becomes coma, tengo becomes tenga, hago becomes haga."
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "title": "From the yo form",
        "rows": [
